                                                                <rect key="frame" x="44" y="22" width="309" height="77.666666666666671"/>
                                                                <string key="text">Tilt your wrist left or right (roll) to move the cursor horizontally. Tilt it up or down (pitch) to move the cursor vertically. Small unintentional movements are filtered out to help keep the cursor steady and improve writing accuracy.</string>
