                                                                <string key="text">Once recording stops, the captured stroke data is processed by the handwriting recognition system. The system analyzes the shape drawn on the canvas, identifies the corresponding letter, and adds it to your message. The recognized letter is also spoken aloud for confirmation. If recognition is unsuccessful, try again.</string>
