                                                        <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="39.999999999999993" width="353" height="100.33333333333331"/>
                                                        <string key="text">Some patients were unable to consistently perform gestures like pinch and clench. Surface Tap lets them communicate by tapping any nearby surface - a bed rail, table, or their own leg. The Apple Watch detects the vibration and helps them navigate through Quick Phrases hands-free.</string>
